WEBVTT

00:10.600 --> 00:12.000
[Respect Copyright, Everyone's Responsibility]

01:06.540 --> 01:08.000
[The Eternal Fragrance]

01:08.000 --> 01:11.980
[Adapted from Shisilang's novel, The Eternal Fragrance]

01:12.020 --> 01:15.140
[Episode 5]

01:19.110 --> 01:20.450
It's not that I don't want to help you.

01:21.390 --> 01:22.980
But a cultivation vessel is something you're born with.

01:23.830 --> 01:24.650
There's no artifact

01:25.160 --> 01:27.370
that can make one.

01:31.800 --> 01:32.700
But I've heard

01:33.190 --> 01:35.170
the academy's herb garden is second to none.

01:35.750 --> 01:37.220
Maybe they've got

01:37.240 --> 01:38.980
some rare treasure that can reshape your meridians.

01:40.670 --> 01:41.860
You're right.

01:43.800 --> 01:44.730
- I'll go find it... - Hold on.

01:49.080 --> 01:50.010
I heard

01:50.720 --> 01:53.250
Elder Zhu, who runs the garden, is strict and fair.

01:53.640 --> 01:55.140
He won't just

01:55.160 --> 01:56.370
give it to you.

01:56.830 --> 01:57.810
Unless

01:59.000 --> 02:00.580
you're someone he really values.

02:03.670 --> 02:04.420
Like him.

02:06.240 --> 02:08.450
A top-tier Metal Spirit Root.

02:21.520 --> 02:23.850
There's stagnant energy around your heart meridians.

02:25.480 --> 02:27.530
Have you been injured lately?

02:30.870 --> 02:31.500
Injured?

02:37.550 --> 02:38.530
Could it be

02:38.960 --> 02:39.900
Hu Jiaping's doing back then?

02:40.480 --> 02:41.810
Good thing you came in time.

02:42.080 --> 02:44.370
Or that stagnant energy would've damaged your heart meridians.

02:44.870 --> 02:47.300
No worries. I'll clear it with some acupuncture.

02:48.480 --> 02:49.780
Could you step out for a bit?

02:51.390 --> 02:51.940
Mr. Zhu,

02:52.670 --> 02:54.370
do you have any elixir

02:54.800 --> 02:56.130
that can heal internal injuries,

02:56.200 --> 02:57.130
boost cultivation,

02:57.430 --> 02:58.570
and fix a cultivation vessel?

02:59.240 --> 02:59.850
What are you up to?

03:03.590 --> 03:05.690
Give this top-tier Metal Spirit Root a little boost.

03:12.920 --> 03:13.740
Look.

03:14.640 --> 03:16.780
Go check... that cabinet...

03:16.800 --> 03:17.780
- over there. - Okay.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.850
This looks like a treasure.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.410
It...

04:01.430 --> 04:02.570
My Divine Tree 1000!

04:14.800 --> 04:16.340
Look what you've done!

04:17.550 --> 04:19.810
I just touched it.

04:20.230 --> 04:20.660
Really.

04:21.030 --> 04:21.420
It...

04:23.080 --> 04:24.420
Is it really rare?

04:24.830 --> 04:25.300
Want me

04:25.880 --> 04:27.100
to find you a new one?

04:27.560 --> 04:28.690
Can't find another.

04:30.150 --> 04:32.810
The Divine Tree is the most mystical tree in the world.

04:33.390 --> 04:34.300
Born from chaos,

04:34.590 --> 04:36.570
it gathers all living vitality.

04:36.910 --> 04:38.890
It bears a single fruit every five hundred years.

04:41.120 --> 04:42.130
I failed again.

04:43.000 --> 04:44.690
I got scammed

04:45.150 --> 04:48.250
999 times

04:49.440 --> 04:52.940
before I got this Divine Tree 1000!

04:55.030 --> 04:56.180
This one's fake too.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.740
Shanhua once told me

05:01.200 --> 05:03.180
the Divine Tree is an immortal, nature-born tree.

05:03.910 --> 05:05.130
Even if struck by heavenly lightning,

05:05.320 --> 05:06.100
it will revive.

05:07.080 --> 05:08.300
It never rots.

05:15.150 --> 05:16.100
I got scammed again.

05:17.390 --> 05:18.690
Is the Divine Tree so powerful?

05:19.030 --> 05:19.890
What's its story?

05:20.830 --> 05:22.250
Five hundred years ago, when the Sea Calamity struck,

05:22.910 --> 05:25.100
the Yecha demon clan appeared with the Divine Tree,

05:25.320 --> 05:26.570
trying to overthrow the Central Plains.

05:26.790 --> 05:29.620
Fortunately, a master from Wuyue Court defeated the Demon Lord

05:29.960 --> 05:31.300
and saved the world from ruin.

05:32.350 --> 05:34.740
That master sounds incredible.

05:35.590 --> 05:36.860
He also created many cultivation techniques.

05:37.200 --> 05:39.330
Each one with power beyond imagination.

06:08.570 --> 06:12.250
♪I trade all the mortal world's splendor♪

06:12.570 --> 06:15.050
♪For a fleeting moment with you♪

06:15.530 --> 06:18.850
♪Our fates intertwined, embracing yet fighting♪

06:19.090 --> 06:20.080
♪The hardest bond to balance♪

06:20.080 --> 06:20.810
What's happening to me?

06:22.440 --> 06:23.660
Whose memories are these?

06:23.660 --> 06:25.810
♪Obsessed and struggling, a thousand thoughts arise♪

06:26.530 --> 06:28.890
♪Love sprouts again in this lifetime♪

06:29.880 --> 06:31.400
♪No calamity can rival♪

06:31.800 --> 06:34.840
♪The lingering thread of a fragrance♪

06:39.350 --> 06:40.420
This is your reward for helping me find the medicine.

06:40.760 --> 06:41.420
Now we're even.

06:51.560 --> 06:52.250
Relax.

06:52.560 --> 06:53.770
This pill stabilizes your core and heals injuries.

06:53.790 --> 06:54.570
It won't poison you.

06:58.640 --> 06:59.180
But

06:59.640 --> 07:01.330
after this, we go our separate ways.

07:01.520 --> 07:02.130
Stay away from me.

07:45.910 --> 07:46.540
What's wrong with you?

07:50.880 --> 07:51.660
Your Highness?

07:55.350 --> 07:57.180
Did Elder Zhu mess up the needles?

07:57.200 --> 07:58.810
He can barely stand.

08:00.470 --> 08:02.420
I'll go back to take some medicine and recover.

08:02.680 --> 08:04.570
I'll leave Xiuyuan to you.

08:12.470 --> 08:13.770
It's been four hours.

08:15.080 --> 08:16.810
They could've at least sent word.

08:18.760 --> 08:19.740
Alright. We'll stop waiting.

08:20.000 --> 08:20.450
Let's go.

08:20.560 --> 08:21.010
Your Ladyship.

08:21.520 --> 08:21.940
Your Ladyship.

08:26.790 --> 08:27.210
Your Ladyship!

08:27.680 --> 08:28.300
- Who? - Lanya.

08:38.440 --> 08:39.140
It's a formation!

08:39.710 --> 08:42.020
This batch of disciples is so clueless.

08:42.510 --> 08:44.420
It took them this long to realize they were trapped.

08:45.230 --> 08:46.420
In a real fight,

08:46.990 --> 08:48.780
they'd be dead a hundred times over.

08:50.320 --> 08:52.330
Ms. Lin is so harsh.

09:10.160 --> 09:11.730
A formation is about alignment.

09:12.160 --> 09:13.300
It maps the cosmic and earthly veins

09:13.830 --> 09:15.060
through numerical variations.

09:15.830 --> 09:18.690
By channeling spirit energy, it strikes unseen.

09:33.630 --> 09:34.660
Focus on guiding your spirit energy,

09:34.920 --> 09:36.300
and you'll see the way out.

09:41.830 --> 09:42.380
Hurry.

09:42.400 --> 09:42.940
I'll wait for you.

09:43.960 --> 09:44.730
Wait... for me?

09:45.110 --> 09:45.730
Why?

09:46.110 --> 09:47.330
To watch me fail? Just go.

10:12.200 --> 10:16.420
Xiaobangchui, drawing talismans is actually simple.

10:17.350 --> 10:19.420
Let your hand follow

10:19.440 --> 10:21.140
what your mind sees.

10:59.510 --> 11:01.210
She actually altered the formation.

11:13.470 --> 11:15.570
Is she connected to the master who set the formation in Gaolu?

11:43.070 --> 11:47.430
♪With you, we climb bleak cliffs beneath endless gloom♪

11:47.560 --> 11:49.840
♪Bow our heads and endure bitter gales♪

11:50.030 --> 11:55.550
♪Ambition surges; we hold new feasts amid thorns♪

11:55.920 --> 11:59.720
♪Climb high, lone sword sings, dance beneath autumn moon♪

12:00.590 --> 12:01.970
Lifei, you did it!

12:02.280 --> 12:07.840
♪Rough the road, yet my steps shall never cease to move♪

12:08.110 --> 12:10.110
♪Banners wave, war drums thunder across the sky♪

12:10.110 --> 12:11.490
Using runes to channel spirit power.

12:12.510 --> 12:13.210
Very clever.

12:13.870 --> 12:14.940
Not at all.

12:15.280 --> 12:16.540
It's just cheap tricks.

12:17.320 --> 12:19.970
Tongzhou, why praise her and not me?

12:20.720 --> 12:24.120
♪Let frost, snow and rain block the long stone steps♪

12:24.520 --> 12:26.440
♪I tread fleeting mist beneath my feet♪

12:28.990 --> 12:29.660
Great.

12:29.660 --> 12:32.300
♪At last I see, life's end lies boundless wild free♪

12:32.920 --> 12:42.040
♪Don't idle away time. We shall meet atop the peak♪

12:42.040 --> 12:43.260
Can't catch a break, can we?

12:57.710 --> 12:58.380
Bees?

13:23.160 --> 13:26.180
Help!

13:31.800 --> 13:32.380
Xiuyuan!

13:32.590 --> 13:33.140
Hold on to me.

13:42.120 --> 13:45.310
♪I trade all the mortal world's splendor♪

13:45.630 --> 13:46.750
♪For a fleeting moment with you♪

13:46.750 --> 13:48.060
Are these bees crazy?

13:48.590 --> 13:49.830
♪Our fates intertwined, embracing yet fighting♪

13:49.830 --> 13:50.570
Could it be...?

13:50.870 --> 13:51.450
It wasn't me!

13:52.150 --> 13:54.350
♪The hardest bond to balance♪

13:55.390 --> 13:58.870
♪Obsessed and struggling, a thousand thoughts arise♪

13:59.590 --> 14:01.950
♪Love sprouts again in this lifetime♪

14:02.550 --> 14:04.070
♪No calamity can rival♪

14:04.470 --> 14:07.510
♪The lingering thread of a fragrance♪

14:22.320 --> 14:23.660
Where are we?

14:27.470 --> 14:28.900
This is the kitchen of Qiaoshan Hall.

14:30.960 --> 14:32.420
So I made it to the cafeteria.

14:35.080 --> 14:35.690
Too bad.

14:37.320 --> 14:38.570
Missed mealtime.

14:41.160 --> 14:41.850
If you're hungry,

14:42.680 --> 14:43.490
I'll go find you something to eat.

14:50.320 --> 14:50.780
Here.

15:03.680 --> 15:04.300
Um,

15:04.710 --> 15:05.850
you don't have to be so nice to me.

15:08.280 --> 15:10.260
I should repay you for saving my life.

15:12.470 --> 15:13.570
You don't have to.

15:13.920 --> 15:15.090
I didn't even mean to save you.

15:47.990 --> 15:48.690
There's a restriction spell.

15:49.470 --> 15:50.420
Who's playing tricks here?

15:54.350 --> 15:55.260
By the power of the spirits,

15:57.040 --> 15:57.610
break!

16:25.040 --> 16:26.020
By the power of the spirits, break!

17:36.230 --> 17:36.900
What's wrong with you?

17:41.070 --> 17:41.660
Are you okay?

17:45.790 --> 17:46.490
What's happening?

17:49.920 --> 17:50.450
What are you doing?

17:55.550 --> 17:56.340
Have you lost your mind?

18:22.750 --> 18:23.450
Are you alright?

18:33.310 --> 18:33.770
Talk.

18:34.360 --> 18:35.250
Who sent you?

18:35.440 --> 18:36.250
Why are you trying to kill us?

18:40.550 --> 18:41.420
Staying silent, huh?

18:43.360 --> 18:44.050
Keep it up,

18:44.790 --> 18:46.100
and I'll toss you into a hotpot.

18:53.960 --> 18:54.450
Mr. Hu,

18:54.790 --> 18:55.690
this coriander spirit...

18:55.960 --> 18:57.340
That's no coriander spirit.

18:59.840 --> 19:02.420
This is my pet, Xiangxiang.

19:03.270 --> 19:04.210
Xiangxiang...?

19:04.230 --> 19:05.730
I was wondering where it went.

19:06.230 --> 19:07.530
So you two caught it.

19:08.640 --> 19:09.340
What?

19:09.990 --> 19:11.140
The grilled fish wasn't enough,

19:11.400 --> 19:12.620
and you wanted a side dish?

19:13.270 --> 19:13.900
No.

19:14.510 --> 19:15.250
It just suddenly...

19:15.270 --> 19:17.180
It was suddenly interrupted during its cultivation.

19:17.710 --> 19:18.690
Since it's your first offense,

19:18.960 --> 19:19.580
I'll let it slide.

19:23.310 --> 19:25.380
Mr. Hu, we're just letting it go?

19:26.160 --> 19:26.730
What else?

19:27.550 --> 19:28.770
You two broke into the kitchen.

19:29.160 --> 19:31.340
Still here? Waiting to be punished?

19:36.470 --> 19:37.050
Get going.

19:41.360 --> 19:42.450
Xiangxiang,

19:42.840 --> 19:44.450
you naughty thing.

19:44.470 --> 19:45.770
Good thing I got here in time.

19:46.200 --> 19:47.420
One more step late

19:47.440 --> 19:48.620
and you'd have been...

19:52.070 --> 19:53.530
I told you to place a seal on them.

19:54.030 --> 19:54.970
Look at you,

19:55.230 --> 19:56.420
getting captured instead.

19:57.360 --> 19:59.730
I did cast the spell just as you told me.

20:00.160 --> 20:02.530
But suddenly I smelled

20:02.550 --> 20:03.730
something so tempting.

20:04.160 --> 20:06.210
And I don't remember anything after that.

20:06.880 --> 20:08.140
By the time I was caught,

20:08.400 --> 20:10.100
demonic energy had already invaded my body.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.970
Mr. Hu, Lei Xiuyuan

20:12.990 --> 20:14.770
is so scary.

20:14.920 --> 20:15.860
Demonic energy?

20:21.960 --> 20:23.620
Looks like our plan backfired.

20:25.120 --> 20:26.620
Our good days are coming to an end.

20:28.840 --> 20:30.450
We need to eliminate them first.

20:33.920 --> 20:35.690
Coincidences don't just happen.

20:36.230 --> 20:38.450
Someone must be behind that bee incident.

20:39.440 --> 20:41.290
Hu Jiaping showed up at the exact perfect moment.

20:42.030 --> 20:43.210
Definitely suspicious.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.940
Why did you pull me just now?

20:58.960 --> 21:00.340
You're acting weird.

21:04.750 --> 21:05.580
What are you thinking?

21:20.400 --> 21:21.970
I knew something was off with you.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.050
Did he notice

21:31.070 --> 21:33.250
Riyan hidden in my hair?

21:34.270 --> 21:35.050
Probably not.

21:50.200 --> 21:51.620
You're pretty good-looking.

21:53.470 --> 21:55.100
But why are you always trying to bite people?

21:55.120 --> 21:56.050
What's wrong with you?

21:57.470 --> 21:59.730
Fine. I'm magnanimous.

21:59.750 --> 22:00.620
I won't hold it against you.

22:09.790 --> 22:11.820
Quiet down, everyone!

22:12.710 --> 22:15.210
Chufeng Academy has been around for a hundred years.

22:15.640 --> 22:16.660
It's where

22:16.680 --> 22:18.690
elite disciples are chosen for the great sects.

22:19.160 --> 22:21.660
It's no place for those who don't measure up.

22:22.230 --> 22:23.770
Those with poor aptitude

22:24.440 --> 22:26.970
or those who slipped in by luck

22:27.550 --> 22:29.860
will be exposed in the monthly exam.

22:32.920 --> 22:33.580
Mr. Hu,

22:34.230 --> 22:35.010
am I right?

22:40.710 --> 22:41.970
Absolutely right.

22:42.400 --> 22:43.620
If that's the case,

22:43.960 --> 22:45.860
then some people who don't belong here

22:45.880 --> 22:47.690
will definitely be leaving.

22:51.070 --> 22:53.490
Never heard anyone admit that about themselves.

23:00.880 --> 23:01.530
Youran,

23:02.200 --> 23:04.050
is the monthly exam every month?

23:04.230 --> 23:05.140
Of course not.

23:05.360 --> 23:06.660
That'd be such a hassle.

23:07.160 --> 23:09.420
This one was Mr. Hu's idea.

23:10.990 --> 23:12.450
Ten days left until the monthly exam.

23:13.270 --> 23:15.290
Hope you'll all work hard

23:15.990 --> 23:17.420
and not disappoint the masters.

23:19.640 --> 23:20.180
Mr. Hu,

23:20.680 --> 23:22.820
what happens if someone fails the monthly exam?

23:24.160 --> 23:25.450
If you fail,

23:26.160 --> 23:27.380
of course you have to

23:27.790 --> 23:29.210
leave the academy.

23:53.160 --> 23:54.660
I don't know if it was that coriander spirit,

23:55.440 --> 23:57.100
but last night I felt dizzy and restless. Couldn't control myself.

23:59.270 --> 23:59.820
Sorry.

24:00.790 --> 24:01.420
Forget it.

24:03.030 --> 24:04.820
Anyway, I know why you approached me now.

24:06.310 --> 24:07.340
It's for Riyan, isn't it?

24:09.120 --> 24:10.820
Someone's using Shanhua's life to force you?

24:13.600 --> 24:14.860
He was Shanhua's master.

24:16.230 --> 24:16.970
But I never expected...

24:17.840 --> 24:18.730
I caused Shanhua's suffering.

24:23.030 --> 24:24.450
I feel sorry for you,

24:24.470 --> 24:25.100
but

24:26.030 --> 24:26.940
I won't help you.

24:27.840 --> 24:28.770
Everyone's busy.

24:28.840 --> 24:30.180
We handle our own problems.

24:30.640 --> 24:31.210
I know.

24:32.230 --> 24:33.180
We have to rely on ourselves.

24:33.880 --> 24:34.940
My cultivation is still weak.

24:35.600 --> 24:37.490
Only by staying here and learning techniques

24:37.880 --> 24:39.050
can I save Shanhua.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.180
It's good that you figured that out.

24:43.880 --> 24:45.490
But now, with powerful enemies around,

24:46.030 --> 24:47.140
if we want to stay,

24:47.160 --> 24:48.450
we need to work together.

24:48.640 --> 24:49.290
Work together?

24:51.120 --> 24:51.690
How?

25:10.510 --> 25:12.380
Whenever I went on a mission with my master,

25:12.400 --> 25:13.690
we'd always track and scout first

25:13.790 --> 25:14.860
to know our enemy.

25:15.550 --> 25:16.450
You mean swindling people?

25:16.960 --> 25:19.050
It's called thorough planning and problem-solving.

25:30.270 --> 25:31.860
This is Ms. Mu's place?

25:37.470 --> 25:38.140
You know,

25:38.790 --> 25:40.210
whether it's a hero or a fool,

25:40.230 --> 25:41.580
they all fall for a pretty face.

25:42.070 --> 25:42.660
Focus on the mission.

25:46.030 --> 25:46.530
Mu.

25:47.680 --> 25:48.210
Mu!

25:49.070 --> 25:49.580
Mu!

25:50.200 --> 25:50.820
Let me go!

25:51.070 --> 25:52.050
Don't come to me again!

25:57.440 --> 25:58.250
Catch him red-handed.

25:59.030 --> 25:59.940
Go inform the headmaster.

26:00.360 --> 26:01.580
When you see him, just say

26:02.840 --> 26:05.100
Hu Jiaping tried to force himself on Mu after being rejected.

26:05.120 --> 26:06.420
He's vile. This is an emergency.

26:06.440 --> 26:07.010
Hurry!

26:46.120 --> 26:47.250
You creep!

27:01.120 --> 27:01.940
You again?

27:02.710 --> 27:03.900
Die!

27:35.120 --> 27:35.820
By the power of the spirits,

27:35.920 --> 27:36.380
break!

27:39.920 --> 27:41.380
Cheap tricks.

27:41.400 --> 27:42.730
Which old scumbag taught you that?

27:43.470 --> 27:44.530
Old scumbag?

27:45.470 --> 27:46.450
You're the old scumbag!

27:46.550 --> 27:47.250
I'll slam you down!

27:47.550 --> 27:48.770
I'll throw you down!

27:49.030 --> 27:49.530
I'll slam...

27:49.880 --> 27:50.250
I...

27:50.360 --> 27:50.970
Lifei.

27:53.400 --> 27:54.010
Lifei.

27:55.640 --> 27:56.290
Ms. Mu,

27:56.550 --> 27:57.180
don't be afraid.

27:57.200 --> 27:57.940
The headmaster is on his way.

27:58.070 --> 27:59.530
This monster won't get his way.

28:02.230 --> 28:02.900
Put her down now!

28:13.880 --> 28:14.490
Mu!

28:15.960 --> 28:16.530
Mu.

28:17.790 --> 28:18.490
Are you okay, Mu?

28:18.680 --> 28:19.140
Mu!

28:19.600 --> 28:20.420
Are you alright, Mu?

28:20.680 --> 28:21.450
Are you hurt?

28:22.270 --> 28:22.770
Easy.

28:24.030 --> 28:24.490
Here.

28:27.310 --> 28:28.450
You're still doing that?

28:28.680 --> 28:29.210
Stop!

28:31.960 --> 28:32.580
Mr. Zuo.

28:34.510 --> 28:35.050
Lifei,

28:35.680 --> 28:36.620
you've all misunderstood.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.900
Jiaping was just healing Mu's injuries.

28:43.440 --> 28:44.010
Mr. Zuo.

28:47.680 --> 28:48.290
How are you?

28:48.920 --> 28:49.860
I'm fine.

28:50.710 --> 28:51.900
Sorry to make you worry.

28:58.920 --> 28:59.730
You two, come with me.

29:11.600 --> 29:15.140
Mu was originally a sword called Lifeng,

29:15.160 --> 29:17.250
of Immortal Guangwei of Wuyue Court.

29:17.710 --> 29:21.050
She and Jiaping grew up together.

29:21.440 --> 29:22.730
They were deeply in love.

29:23.710 --> 29:24.450
Sadly,

29:24.750 --> 29:26.530
when they went to Kongsang to fight monsters,

29:27.070 --> 29:28.660
Mu's blade broke, and her primordial spirit

29:29.200 --> 29:31.730
was severely damaged while saving Jiaping.

29:32.400 --> 29:36.420
Guangwei sent Mu to the academy to recover.

29:37.840 --> 29:38.660
But

29:39.200 --> 29:40.530
Jiaping defied

29:40.920 --> 29:43.210
his master's orders for Mu,

29:43.840 --> 29:45.580
abandoned the righteous path of cultivation,

29:46.200 --> 29:47.860
and left Wuyue Court.

29:48.600 --> 29:49.490
That madman...

29:52.550 --> 29:54.450
Mr. Hu is quite the romantic.

29:58.270 --> 29:59.290
For all these years,

30:00.160 --> 30:03.530
he's been searching for a way to reforge Lifeng,

30:04.990 --> 30:06.210
but never found one.

30:06.750 --> 30:09.620
Since humans and spirits are different,

30:09.790 --> 30:11.180
Mu refused to drag Jiaping down.

30:11.470 --> 30:12.770
She's been avoiding him.

30:14.680 --> 30:18.530
That's why you saw what happened earlier.

30:21.510 --> 30:22.660
If you ask me,

30:23.160 --> 30:25.450
the academy's rules need to change.

30:28.550 --> 30:29.180
How so?

30:30.710 --> 30:32.820
On our first day here, you said

30:33.200 --> 30:34.140
cultivation

30:34.160 --> 30:35.770
means letting go of worldly ties.

30:36.030 --> 30:37.140
My master also said

30:37.600 --> 30:40.010
cultivation is about transcending worldly conventions.

30:40.920 --> 30:42.770
These two are clearly in love.

30:42.960 --> 30:44.140
They end up like a miserable couple.

30:44.310 --> 30:45.100
What does that show?

30:46.160 --> 30:49.140
It shows our academy has failed in its teaching.

30:52.760 --> 30:54.020
Are your sunflower seeds tasty?

30:56.270 --> 30:58.090
It shows Mr. Hu

30:58.350 --> 30:59.850
is narrow-minded

30:59.870 --> 31:00.690
and cowardly.

31:01.270 --> 31:03.180
He can't let go of gossip or prejudice.

31:03.640 --> 31:04.770
How can he even cultivate like this?

31:05.160 --> 31:05.770
So rigid.

31:06.070 --> 31:07.180
How can he teach disciples?

31:08.640 --> 31:09.690
If you ask me, he should be

31:10.750 --> 31:11.290
expelled.

31:11.710 --> 31:12.530
Let him reflect on himself.

31:17.790 --> 31:19.490
If Hu Jiaping gets kicked out,

31:19.510 --> 31:20.580
everyone will be thrilled.

31:21.960 --> 31:23.420
You don't hold prejudice against other races.

31:24.400 --> 31:25.140
That's good.

31:25.990 --> 31:26.940
But in this world,

31:27.230 --> 31:29.970
it's hard for different races to accept each other.

31:30.510 --> 31:33.660
Public opinion can destroy a person.

31:41.160 --> 31:42.420
If public opinion can break you,

31:43.230 --> 31:45.250
it just means your will isn't strong enough.

31:46.550 --> 31:47.580
If it were me,

31:47.880 --> 31:50.010
I wouldn't care if he's human or a demon.

31:50.400 --> 31:51.580
If we truly loved each other,

31:51.750 --> 31:52.900
I'd tear down every obstacle

31:52.920 --> 31:54.010
and never back down.

31:58.510 --> 31:59.290
Lifei,

32:00.120 --> 32:02.010
you haven't yet experienced the world's suffering.

32:02.550 --> 32:04.140
You can't understand others' pain.

32:05.160 --> 32:08.140
The mortals have their laws and conventions.

32:08.680 --> 32:13.010
And we immortals have our rules and order.

32:14.160 --> 32:15.420
It's a long story.

32:16.510 --> 32:17.340
You'll understand

32:18.160 --> 32:19.530
in time.

32:23.510 --> 32:24.620
It's getting late.

32:26.440 --> 32:27.620
I should rest.

32:34.790 --> 32:35.340
Mr. Zuo.

32:38.470 --> 32:39.380
Do you also think

32:40.030 --> 32:40.820
it's not worth

32:41.710 --> 32:43.010
doing things you shouldn't

32:43.790 --> 32:44.420
for personal feelings?

32:47.920 --> 32:49.010
Whether it's worth it

32:49.750 --> 32:50.860
comes down to your own heart.

32:52.120 --> 32:53.290
Every encounter

32:53.960 --> 32:55.340
has its own karma.

32:56.230 --> 32:57.490
We cultivators

32:57.880 --> 32:59.490
are already going against heaven.

33:03.510 --> 33:04.620
Staying true to our hearts

33:05.840 --> 33:07.050
is our only path.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.380
Hu Jiaping

33:30.550 --> 33:31.660
must have noticed by now.

33:33.120 --> 33:34.050
What do we do now?

33:36.550 --> 33:37.580
You're the old scumbag!

33:37.680 --> 33:38.770
I'll slam you down!

33:38.880 --> 33:39.340
I...

33:41.550 --> 33:43.730
Stay true to our hearts

33:44.710 --> 33:46.100
and sneak into the Script Tower.

33:46.470 --> 33:47.970
You actually got the key.

33:48.360 --> 33:50.250
Fine. I'll go in with you.

34:01.960 --> 34:03.730
Legend says the Futu Tower in the academy

34:03.840 --> 34:06.010
holds many advanced cultivation techniques from across the realms.

34:06.880 --> 34:08.380
There must be secret manuals on cultivating

34:08.400 --> 34:09.860
spirit power and enhancing cultivation.

34:16.030 --> 34:17.260
Brown is earth.

34:17.840 --> 34:18.820
Red is fire.

34:19.510 --> 34:20.420
Blue is water.

34:20.840 --> 34:21.700
Green is wood.

34:22.360 --> 34:23.380
Yellow is metal.

34:26.360 --> 34:27.170
It's the Five Elements Formation.

34:53.360 --> 34:54.130
- This... - Let's go.

34:54.720 --> 34:55.490
Already...?

35:29.030 --> 35:30.490
So many books.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.940
How are we supposed to find it?

36:14.760 --> 36:15.300
Let's do this.

36:16.320 --> 36:17.170
I'll search this side.

36:17.630 --> 36:18.420
You search that side.

36:18.760 --> 36:19.900
We'll each get what we need.

36:31.240 --> 36:34.090
I never expected so many fire-element texts.

36:53.280 --> 36:54.490
Been searching for ages.

36:54.880 --> 36:56.650
Nothing on cultivating spirit energy at all.

37:24.280 --> 37:25.860
The Xuanhua Sacred Fire Record?

37:27.400 --> 37:28.380
But Uncle said

37:28.800 --> 37:30.650
this book has been lost for thousands of years.

37:40.110 --> 37:43.650
Xuanhua Sacred Fire, Netherworld Dark Flame.

37:54.360 --> 37:57.970
Among the 3,900 ways to control spirits in the world,

37:58.510 --> 38:00.130
the cultivation vessel is one of them.

38:00.740 --> 38:02.480
[The Record of Spirit Release]

38:04.360 --> 38:05.130
Found it.

38:10.190 --> 38:11.050
I'll try this.

38:11.510 --> 38:12.220
See if it works.

38:16.150 --> 38:17.300
The Spirit-Releasing Immortal-Slaying Formation?

38:19.030 --> 38:20.300
Gather the spirit and condense it into the vessel.

38:21.110 --> 38:22.340
Nourish it with blood.

38:22.960 --> 38:23.860
Channel it through the meridians.

38:24.670 --> 38:27.220
Release it all in one instant strike

38:29.550 --> 38:30.700
to take down the enemy with you.

39:08.400 --> 39:09.650
This killing formation isn't about survival.

39:10.550 --> 39:12.010
It's a mutual destruction spell.

39:20.470 --> 39:22.090
Shanhua is barely hanging on.

39:22.190 --> 39:23.820
Don't delay any longer!

39:40.760 --> 39:41.380
This is bad.

39:41.840 --> 39:42.900
Did I practice it wrong?

39:53.470 --> 39:54.450
What are you trying to do?

39:54.960 --> 39:55.780
Don't do anything reckless.

39:55.840 --> 39:56.490
Don't speak.

40:06.360 --> 40:08.610
Calm your mind, regulate your breath, and clear your meridians.

40:09.550 --> 40:12.010
Observe outward form, discern inward heart.

40:15.510 --> 40:16.090
Thanks.

40:17.360 --> 40:18.130
Focus.

40:35.400 --> 40:36.380
I need to find Riyan

40:37.150 --> 40:37.900
before she notices.

41:08.840 --> 41:09.880
[Zong Quan, Longming Sanctuary]

41:09.880 --> 41:10.900
Divine Tree?

41:12.550 --> 41:14.720
[Cuixuan, Wuyue Court]

41:18.110 --> 41:19.530
Head to Chufeng Academy now.

41:20.150 --> 41:21.940
Find out where the Divine Tree is.

41:22.360 --> 41:22.860
[Qin Yangling, Wuyue Court]
Yes.

41:25.440 --> 41:27.420
The aura of the Divine Tree!

41:43.160 --> 41:46.840
♪I trade all the mortal world's splendor♪

41:47.160 --> 41:49.640
♪For a fleeting moment with you♪

41:50.120 --> 41:53.440
♪Our fates intertwined, embracing yet fighting♪

41:53.680 --> 41:55.880
♪The hardest bond to balance♪

41:56.920 --> 42:00.400
♪Obsessed and struggling, a thousand thoughts arise♪

42:01.120 --> 42:03.480
♪Love sprouts again in this lifetime♪

42:04.080 --> 42:05.600
♪No calamity can rival♪

42:06.000 --> 42:09.040
♪The lingering thread of a fragrance♪

42:10.790 --> 42:14.320
♪If the seal can't be broken, then let it go♪

42:14.990 --> 42:17.360
♪Where the heart finds peace, there is home♪

42:17.680 --> 42:20.880
♪Side by side, we fly through seas of clouds and break through the waves♪

42:21.480 --> 42:23.760
♪The heart's ocean knows no shore♪

42:24.160 --> 42:27.880
♪Always, at the very end of fate♪

42:28.520 --> 42:30.920
♪Comes that one moment of defiance♪

42:31.360 --> 42:34.520
♪In the human world or above, like flowing water♪

42:35.120 --> 42:37.480
